OL,3,GNEWSALibraries will not remove Walliams
OL,4,Abooks, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent County Council says it will not
OL,7,Fremove books written by David Walliams
OL,8,Ffrom its libraries following
OL,9,Fallegations of sexual misconduct made
OL,10,Fagainst him.
OL,12,FA council spokesperson said there were
OL,13,F"no plans" to remove Walliams' titles
OL,14,Ffrom its shelves, adding that decisions
OL,15,Fabout its stock were "not made through
OL,16,Fblanket bans on individual authors".
OL,18,FThe decision has drawn criticism from
OL,19,Fsome opposition councillors, while
OL,20,Fothers have defended its actions.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
