OL,3,GNEWSALibraries will not remove Walliams
OL,4,Abooks, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports by ITV News and the Guardian on
OL,7,FTuesday alleged that Walliams had been
OL,8,Faccused of sexual misconduct by several
OL,9,Fwomen. He denies all of the allegations
OL,10,Fagainst him.
